CustomizationDialogWidget.showCustomization(
  context,
  productTitle: "Filter Coffee",
  productPrice: "60.0 TL",
  imageUrl: "[https://example.com/coffee.jpg](https://example.com/coffee.jpg)",
  category: "Hot Drinks",
  primaryColor: Colors.brown,
  onAddToCart: (customizedProduct) {
    print("Added product: ${customizedProduct["title"]} with price ${customizedProduct["price"]}");
  },
);
productTitle — The name of the product being customized. This field is required.

productPrice — The initial string representation of the product price. This field is required.

modifierGroups — A list of custom option groups rendered dynamically.

recipe — A list of recipe ingredients that the user can choose to remove.